    "cases": [
      "construction and the main entrypoint perform no provider I/O or credential discovery",
      "invalid options are rejected before any fetch, including accessors and unknown fields",
      "endpoints reject credentials, query, fragment, non-loopback HTTP and implicit HTTP permission",
      "the request explicitly sets model, storage, schema, limits, authorization and redirect policy",
      "actions use the runtime callback sequentially and send its fresh observation next",
      "all public target kinds and fill/press actions retain their exact values",
      "invalid selectors, scripts, keys and irrelevant fields never dispatch an action",
      "assertions admit only explicit semantic verdicts and send a mutation-free schema",
      "assertion actions and mode-inappropriate verdicts fail closed",
      "completed provider transport never substitutes for a semantic success",
      "refusal, incomplete, failed and provider error responses do not pass",
      "ambiguous messages, content and non-assistant output are rejected",
      "a reasoning item before one complete assistant decision is accepted",
      "HTTP failures, redirects and wrong content types receive no retry and expose no body",
      "malformed JSON, malformed decision JSON and invalid UTF-8 are finite errors",
      "response bytes are capped while streaming even without content-length",
      "an oversized declared body is cancelled without reading it",
      "request exhaustion reports blocked without retries or claimed success",
      "already-aborted work never sends a request or dispatches an action",
      "cancellation fences a late fetch and disposes its body even when transport ignores abort",
      "cancellation interrupts a pending response read and cancels the stream",
      "aborting at the transport boundary prevents the returned action",
      "cancellation after an action starts prevents another provider request",
      "opaque transport failures are redacted while runtime action errors retain their code",
      "oversized observations fail before transport, including fresh action observations",
      "real session action limits remain sticky and cleanup preserves the failed verdict"
    ],
    "tapSHA256": "44677389e9f7282f8180c6ccb95efa7cb717b09eb9b0011573204a822c733817"
  },
